                    🎯 Active Trade Plan <span class="ticker-badge" id="plan-ticker">—</span></div><div class="plan-grid"><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Entry Price</div><div class="value" id="plan-entry">—</div></div><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Stop Loss</div><div class="value red" id="plan-stop">—</div></div><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Target 1</div><div class="value green" id="plan-t1">—</div></div><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Target 2</div><div class="value green" id="plan-t2">—</div></div><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Target 3</div><div class="value green" id="plan-t3">—</div></div><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Shares</div><div class="value blue" id="plan-shares">—</div></div><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Position Value</div><div class="value" id="plan-position">—</div></div><div class="plan-stat"><div class="label">Risk:Reward</div><div class="value green" id="plan-rr">—</div></div></div><div class="plan-rules"><h4>📋 Rules / Filters Applied</h4><ul id="plan-rules-list"><li>Price range: $0.20–$50 ✅</li><li>Market cap: $300K–$5B ✅</li><li>Cap-size badges (market cap based): NANO CAP &lt; $50M · MICRO CAP $50M–$300M · SMALL CAP $300M–$2B ✅</li><li>Penny-stock badge when price &lt; $1.00 ✅</li><li>Active mover ≥5% or RVOL ≥1.0x ✅</li><li>Minimum current volume 50,000 shares ✅</li><li>Max float 100M shares; volume/float ≥0.5x (≥1.0x for $5M–$10M tiny-caps) ✅</li><li>Move cap 800% (tier-2 exception up to 1,500% with RVOL ≥1.5x &amp; VFR ≥0.5x); tiny-cap tier up to 150% ✅</li><li><strong>Hyper-scalp exception:</strong> +30%+ move, RVOL ≥1.5x, current session dollar volume ≥$100K and avg daily dollar volume $100K–$500K passes the dollar-volume floor in all phases ✅</li><li>Near demand zone, candlestick signal, price above VWAP — context, not hard filters ✅</li><li>News catalyst scored ≥3 from ≥2 sources ✅</li><li><strong>Catalyst watchlist (Sydney 17:00–17:59):</strong> news/catalyst score ≥3 only; no price, volume, float, or move filters applied ✅</li><li>Red flags block: offering, dilution, bankruptcy, delisting, SEC investigation, restated, going concern, short report ✅</li><li>Volume indicator: today's volume vs 3-month average (RVOL) ✅</li><li>Risk:Reward ≥2.0:1 ✅</li><li>Position sizing: R = account balance × max daily loss % ÷ max trades per day; shares = R ÷ (entry − stop) ✅</li><li>Scale out: 50% at T1, 25% at T2, trail rest above T3; breakeven stop after +1% ✅</li></ul><h4>📼 Volume Indicator</h4><div class="tape-legend" id="tape-legend"><p class="tape-note"><span class="tape-mini tape-high">🔥</span> = high volume (RVOL ≥ 2.0) · <span class="tape-mini tape-medium">⚡</span> = moderate volume (RVOL 1.0 – 1.99) · <span class="tape-mini tape-low">🌱</span> = low volume (RVOL &lt; 1.0)</p></div></div><div class="plan-rules" id="plan-exit" style="border-left-color: var(--accent-amber); margin-top: 0.5rem;"><h4 style="color: var(--accent-amber);">⏱ Exit Strategy</h4><ul id="plan-exit-rules"><li>Select an alert to see exit rules.</li></ul></div><div class="performance-card" id="performance-card"><h2>📈 Forecast vs Actual Tracker <span class="ticker-badge" id="perf-ticker">—</span></h2><div class="perf-grid"><div class="perf-box"><div class="label">Share Qty</div><div class="value" id="perf-investment">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-investment-sub">Webull executes by qty</div></div><div class="perf-box"><div class="label">Proposed Entry</div><div class="value" id="perf-entry">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-entry-sub">—</div></div><div class="perf-box"><div class="label">Current Price</div><div class="value" id="perf-current">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-current-sub">—</div></div><div class="perf-box"><div class="label">P&amp;L if Executed</div><div class="value" id="perf-pnl">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-pnl-sub">—</div></div><div class="perf-box highlight"><div class="label">P&amp;L @ T1 (full)</div><div class="value green" id="perf-t1-pnl">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-t1-pnl-sub">—</div></div><div class="perf-box highlight"><div class="label">P&amp;L @ T2 (full)</div><div class="value green" id="perf-t2-pnl">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-t2-pnl-sub">—</div></div><div class="perf-box highlight"><div class="label">P&amp;L @ T3 (full)</div><div class="value green" id="perf-t3-pnl">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-t3-pnl-sub">—</div></div><div class="perf-box"><div class="label">Max Risk</div><div class="value red" id="perf-risk">—</div><div class="sub" id="perf-risk-sub">—</div></div></div></div><div class="news-catalyst-card" id="news-catalyst-section"><div class="news-header"><h2>📰 Latest Catalyst &amp; News</h2><span class="impact-badge" id="impact-score">—</span></div><p class="news-legend">🕒 Timestamps show each article/announcement’s own first publication age (not scan time). Hover the age badge for the exact date/time. ⚠️ = older than 7 days.</p><div class="news-ticker-line" id="news-ticker-line">
